---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title={"Support | Roos Instruments"}
  description={"Roos Instruments technical and engineering support for Cassini ATE and turn-key test solustions to your most challenging test needs."}
  active={["nav-support","nav-mobile-support"]}>
    <!-- ==========================
    	BREADCRUMB - START
    =========================== -->
    <section class="breadcrumb-wrapper">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Support</h1>
        <ol class="breadcrumb">
          <li><a href="/index.html">Home</a></li>
          <li class="active">Support</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>
    <!-- ==========================
    	BREADCRUMB - END
    =========================== -->
    <div id="content">
      <section class="roosC container">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="text-center col-xs-12 col-sm-4">
            <h3>Get Support</h3>
            <ul style="margin-left:0;margin-bottom:15px">
              <li style="padding-top:0"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:support@roos.com"><i
                    class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i> Email Support</a></li>
              <li style="padding-top:15px"><a href="tel:+1-408-748-8589">&nbsp;<i
                    class="fa-solid fa-phone"></i>&nbsp;&nbsp;+1-408-748-8589</a></li>
              <li><small><i class="far fa-clock">&nbsp;</i>9:00AM-7:00PM PST M-F</small></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-center col-xs-12 col-sm-4">
              <h3>Reference Guide <a href="https://roos.com/refGuide" title="Cassini Reference Guide Share Link"><i
                    class="fa-solid fa-share"></i></a>
              </h3>
              <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/pdf/CassiniReferenceGuide_2.8_mini.pdf"><i
                  class="far fa-file-pdf"></i>Download PDF</a>
              <a href="https://itunes.apple.com/us/book/cassini-reference-guide/id816739794?mt=11&uo=10"><img
                  style="padding-top:9px;width:160px" class="centerImg" src="/images/ibook-cassini-ref-guide.png"
                  alt="Cassini Reference Guide iBook"></a>
            </div>
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-4">
              <h3 class="text-center">Support Planning</h3>
              <div style="width:150px" class="centerImg">
                <ul style="margin-left:0;margin-top:15px" class="nav vertical-nav">
                  <li><a href="/supportPlans.html"><i class="fa-solid fa-angles-right"></i>Support Plans</a></li>
                  <li><a href="/maintenance.html"><i class="fa-solid fa-angles-right"></i>Maintenance</a></li>
                  <li><a href="/docs"><i class="fa-solid fa-angles-right"></i>Training</a></li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="search-doc-bar">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-md-5 hidden-xs hidden-sm">
            <h2>Search Documentation</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-7">
            <form name="docsSearch3" method="POST" action="#" onsubmit="return goSearch3(),!1">
              <div class="form-group nospace">
                <div class="input-group">
                  <input type="text" class="form-control" id="query3" placeholder="Search Online Documentation"
                    required> <span onclick="return goSearch3(),!1" class="input-group-btn"><button style="margin-top:0"
                      class="btn btn-primary" type="button" title="Search"><i class="fa-solid fa-search"></i></button></span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div id="searchFail3" class="alert alert-warning hidden" role="alert"><strong>Oops!</strong> Search for
                something.</div>
            </form>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <div class="roosC container"><div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-4">
          <hr class="space hidden-xs">
          <h3>Return Instructions</h3>
          <ul style="margin-top:3px" class="nav vertical-nav">
            <li><a href="/maintenance.html" title="Exchanging a TIM"><i class="fa-solid fa-angles-right"></i>Exchange TIM Checklist</a></li>
            <li><a href="/pdf/Pack_TIM.pdf" title="Instructions for Packing a Testhead/EPC TIM"><i
              class="fa-solid fa-file-pdf"></i> Pack TIM</a></li>
            <li><a href="/pdf/Pack_AUX_Src.pdf"
              title="Instructions for Packing a Testhead/EPC TIM"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-pdf"></i> Pack AUX TIM
              (RI7725)</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="col-sm-4">
          <hr class="space hidden-xs">
          <h3>Documents By Role</h3>
          <ul style="margin-top:3px" class="nav vertical-nav">
            <li><a href="/help/dev"><i class="fa-solid fa-angles-right"></i>Developer</a></li>
            <li><a href="/help/admin"><i class="fa-solid fa-angles-right"></i>Administrator</a></li>
            <li><a href="/help/maint"><i class="fa-solid fa-angles-right"></i>Maintenance</a></li>
            <li><a href="/help/operate"><i class="fa-solid fa-angles-right"></i>Operator</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-4">
          <hr class="space hidden-xs">
          <h3>Documents By Topic</h3>
          <ul style="margin-top:3px" class="nav vertical-nav">
            <li><a href="/roos/Documentation.nsf/webTopicFixturing?OpenView"><i
                  class="fa-solid fa-angles-right"></i>Fixturing</a></li>
            <li><a href="/roos/Documentation.nsf/webTopicTestPlans?OpenView"><i
                  class="fa-solid fa-angles-right"></i>Test Plan Development</a></li>
            <li><a href="/roos/Documentation.nsf/webTopicSoftware?OpenView"><i class="fa-solid fa-angles-right"></i>RI
                Software</a></li>
            <li><a href="/roos/Documentation.nsf/webTopicPartSpecs?OpenView"><i
                  class="fa-solid fa-angles-right"></i>Hardware Specs</a></li>
            <li><a href="/roos/Documentation.nsf/webByTopic?OpenView"><i class="fa-solid fa-angles-right"></i>All
                Topics</a></li>
            <li><a href="/docs"><i class="fa-solid fa-angles-right"></i>All
                Documents</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div></div>
      <div class="roosC container"><div class="row">
        <div style="margin-bottom: 50px;" class="col-xs-12">
          <h3>Diagnose and Calibration</h3>
          <p>Detailed Diagnose and Calibration information and procedures are in the <a href="/refGuide"
              title="Cassini Reference Guide">Cassini Reference Guide</a>, CH 5: Diagnose and CH 6: Calibration.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Diagnostic Kits: custom interface fixture, cables and components needed to self-diagnose issues.
              (included with system order, required for Calibration)</li>
            <li><a
                href="/commerce/catalog.nsf/accessoriesbyType?openform&RestrictToCategory=Calibration+Tools">Calibration
                Kits</a>: used to calibrate RF system, frequency dependant.</li>
            <li><a href="/docs/RBEH-6XH5L4">Calibration - Written Procedure for Complete Cassini System Cal</a></li>
            <li><a href="/pdf/RoosCalibrationScope_v2.0.pdf">Calibration Scope</a> (DC-88 GHz)</li>
          </ul>
          <p style="margin-top: 30px;">International Shipments: <br>ECCN 3B992.b <br> 
            <a href="https://hts.usitc.gov/search?query=9030.82.00.00" rel="external">HTC 9030.82.00.00</a> RF Test Equipment Accessories</p>
        </div>
      </div></div>
    </div>
</Base>
